{"data":{"title":"Everyday","slug":"everyday","path":"/artists/jamiroquai/tracks/everyday/","artwork":"images/artists/jamiroquai/tracks/everyday.jpg","artist":{"id":"nuFz-_zDxKk","slug":"jamiroquai","links":null,"title":"Jamiroquai","artwork":null},"id":"F9D1hvD_hqk"},"appearanceCount":5,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"UQKUtJsffKA","show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"cu66257CzOA","show":{"id":"FASt_673SAE","slug":"266","title":"Soulection Radio Show #266 w/ Smino","artwork":"/images/episodes/266.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2016-07-02T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"e2J-xyKDkw8","show":{"id":"wRoYZc4zo_8","slug":"318","title":"Soulection Radio Show #318 (Live from Brussels, Belgium)","artwork":"/images/episodes/318.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-07-15T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"LHnWwMjmJd4","show":{"id":"ZEQhUhb44F0","slug":"578","title":"Soulection Radio Show #578","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-578.jpg","content":"Joe Kay goes deep in his archive for some R&B, soul, and beats.\n<!--more-->\n","published_at":"2023-01-15T15:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"2c-x